AstroHybrid patch series
------------------------
https://github.com/imnotsharingmyname/pcportastrobot, folder Source/kyty-hybrid (36 patches on KytyPS5). The series
is a derivative of the GPL-2.0 KytyPS5 and is used under GPL-2.0: nativeps5-kyty carries it as 36 commits with
their author, directly on the upstream tag (the GPU bridge, src/hybrid/, the u59 preset), and
titles/kyty-preset.env here restates the preset of that tree (tools/u59-preset.json) as environment words. Running
Kyty's renderer inside a natively translated program is that author's idea; credit for that work belongs to them. Nothing else from that repository (its launcher application, documents,
release tooling), which carries no licence, is included or was copied; it was read for ideas only.

NXNative
--------
https://github.com/seedds/nxnative, MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 seedds. Read as a reference for running
console games natively on Apple platforms. Reused with attribution in the component repositories: the ordering of
MetalFX upscaling relative to encoder barriers and the conventions for passing a game's own upscaler inputs to
MetalFX, and the cap on shader loop iterations. The contribution rules in CONTRIBUTING.md and AGENTS.md follow the
